Add this entry in its place in the list sorted by `set` (after `office-pptx-writer-text` if that set is listed, else where the
sorted order puts `office-pptx-build`):

    {
      "command": "node benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-pptx-build.mjs --tree <tree>",
      "fileCount": 1,
      "manifest": "office-pptx-build/MANIFEST.json",
      "manifestSha256": "c64c9095e1052f5fd86e4aae19f37fc8097c38640f1d40c592066385bc46fa25",
      "recorder": "benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-pptx-build.mjs",
      "set": "office-pptx-build",
