(Recorded from the product tree at C:/Project/mixdog, which is not an exact commit export, so the set's manifest has
`product.commit` null like the other office sets. native/core/fixtures/office-pptx-build/ is in this task's commit, added with
`git add --sparse`.)

## 4. SERVICE_PENDING (compose_flip.rs)
No name to remove: this task registers no service.

## 5. What the later tasks take from this one
- nr-office-engine-author-actions (the `author` action's HTML input):
  `pptx_html_runner::run_pptx_html_authoring(endpoint, tokens, &SvgFonts, note, html, output, RunOptions::new(target))` answers
  the run's result JSON (`ok`, `output`, `bytes`, `logs`, `kit: "html"`, `slideCount`, `normalizedParagraphs`, `htmlShots`,
  `htmlText`, `htmlSource`, `geometry`, `elapsedMs`; or `{ ok: false, error: { message, line, excerpt }, logs, elapsedMs }`);
  `RunOptions.prepare` names the canvas on the loaded page (the PDF's designed pages pass their sheet);
  `pptx_html_runner::{html_artifacts, has_slide_sections, measure_html_drift, write_html_comparisons}` are the artifact
  names, the page-contract check, the `html_render_drift` read and the comparison images; the brief of an HTML deck is
  `brief::html_brief_script` (already in the crate). `SvgFonts` is built by the caller from the font registry
  (`SvgFonts::from_registry(proof, registry)`), so an SVG drawing's text is set in the same faces as the rest of the product.
- The PDF designed pages (the route that prints a measured sheet): `pptx_build::build_pptx_from_measure(canvas, slides, fonts, pictures)` takes
  the measure's own sheet (`Canvas { inch_width, inch_height }`) and `pptx_build::local_pictures(slides)` names the `file:`
  pictures to read first.
- Two tests of `pptx-html-build.test.mjs` read other modules and are not ported here: the portable measure of a soft break
  (`portable-pptx-core` / `text-metrics`) and the ornamental stripe (`quality/design-review-authored`); they belong to those
  modules' tasks. The brief comment test is in pptx_html_runner's tests; the session half of `pptx-html-reauthor.slow.test.mjs`
  (`batch`, `replacedEdits`, the refusal with no source) belongs to nr-office-engine-author-actions.
